<Slide style={{ background: '#FBF8F3', padding: '60px 60px 60px 60px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#D8623B' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#12211F' }}>最优性验证：跟全排列穷举对一遍</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', marginTop: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 660 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7C918D', letterSpacing: 3 }}>与可证明最优的平均差距</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 104, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D8623B', lineHeight: 1.05, letterSpacing: -4, marginTop: 4 }}>0.00%</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#435B57', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                小规模算例可以把每一种访问顺序都试一遍，得到的不再是上界、而是真正的最优。
                在这条基准线上，本方案的解一次都没有跑偏。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 0, flex: 1, paddingBottom: 6 }}>
            {[
                ['3 / 3', '组真实景点算例全部命中最优'],
                ['720', '种排列被逐一遍历过'],
                ['75.4×', 'n=8 时相对穷举的加速比'],
            ].map(([n, d]) => (
                <Box key={n} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 14, paddingTop: 11, paddingBottom: 11, borderTop: '1px solid #E4DCD0' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0C3B3C', width: 108 }}>{n}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#435B57', flex: 1 }}>{d}</Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#7C918D', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 10 }}>规模上去以后，穷举爆炸而启发式几乎不动</Text>
        <Table
            style={{ width: '100%', height: 236 }}
            defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 15, textAlign: 'center', color: '#12211F' }}
            defaultCellStyle={{ border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E4DCD0' } } }}
            cells={[
                [
                    { text: '景点数', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#435B57', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D3C8B8' } } } },
                    { text: '排列数', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#435B57', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D3C8B8' } } } },
                    { text: '全排列穷举', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#435B57', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D3C8B8' } } } },
                    { text: '本方案', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0C3B3C', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D3C8B8' } } } },
                    { text: '差距', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#435B57', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D3C8B8' } } } },
                    { text: '加速', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#D8623B', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D3C8B8' } } } },
                ],
                ['4', '24', '0.4 ms', { text: '8.9 ms', textStyle: { color: '#0C3B3C', bold: true } }, '0%', '—'],
                ['5', '120', '2.7 ms', { text: '10.9 ms', textStyle: { color: '#0C3B3C', bold: true } }, '0%', '0.2×'],
                ['6', '720', '18.1 ms', { text: '12.9 ms', textStyle: { color: '#0C3B3C', bold: true } }, '0.08%', '1.4×'],
                ['7', '5,040', '147.4 ms', { text: '14.8 ms', textStyle: { color: '#0C3B3C', bold: true } }, '0.37%', '10×'],
                ['8', '40,320', { text: '1,391.8 ms', textStyle: { color: '#D8623B', bold: true } }, { text: '18.5 ms', textStyle: { color: '#0C3B3C', bold: true } }, '0.06%', { text: '75.4×', textStyle: { color: '#D8623B', bold: true } }],
            ]}
        />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #E4DCD0', paddingTop: 12, marginTop: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#435B57' }}>
            规模从 4 到 8，穷举耗时涨约 3,500 倍，本方案只涨 2 倍 —— 差距会随着景点变多而继续拉开。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#7C918D' }}>06</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
